  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際貿易時文導讀(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS ENGLISH (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要目的為加強英文閱讀訓練。課堂上協助同學接觸各種商用英文書報資訊，透過閱讀相關商用報刊及雜誌，以深化英語閱讀、口說、與聽力的技能。教師引導同學認識並討論各項國貿商用議題，培養學生在職場所需之口語及書寫溝通技巧，能撰寫與職場相關之英文文件，並使用英文進行有效且適當的溝通。",
    "describe_eh": "The main purpose of this course is to strengthen English reading training. , students are assisted in accessing various business English books and newspapers. By reading relevant business newspapers and magazines, students can deepen their English reading, speaking, and listening skills. Teachers guide students to understand and discuss various international business issues, and develop their oral and writing skills in the workplace, enable to write documents and communicate effectively in English.",
