    "course_pol": "Students with three or more unexcused absences will have 10 point deducted from their final score. 無故缺席 3 次或以上的學生將從最終成績中扣除 10 分。\nStudents with three or more unexcused absences will have 10 point deducted from their final score. 無故缺席 3 次或以上的學生將從最終成績中扣除 10 分。",
    "course_pol_en": "ANY STUDENT WITH THREE OR MORE UNEXCUSED ABSENCES WILL RECEIVE A 10-POINT REDUCTION OF THEIR FINALS SEMESTER GRADE. STUDENTS CAN DISCUSS ANY PLANNED OR NECESSARY ABSENCES WITH THE LECTURER.\n任何無故缺席 3 次或以上的學生，期末成績將被扣 10 分。學生可以與講師討論任何計劃或必要的缺席。",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>Studying hard is essential for success in life. It helps us to develop critical thinking skills, acquire knowledge and skills that are necessary for success, build character and discipline, create opportunities, and become responsible members of society.</div>\n\n<div>努力學習對於人生的成功至關重要。它幫助我們發展批判性思考技能，獲得成功所需的知識和技能，塑造品格和紀律，創造機會，並成為負責任的社會成員。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>STUDENTS ARE EXPECTED TO COMPLETE ALL GIVEN TASKS AND ASIGNMENS AS WELL AS CULTIVATE A ROUTINE OF READING BUSINESS AND ECONOMIC NEWS ARTICLES ON A ROUTINE BASIS, IN CHINESE AS WELL AS ENGLISH.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>學生應完成所有指定的任務和分配，並養成定期閱讀中文和英文商業和經濟新聞文章的習慣。</div>\n\n<div>Studying hard is essential for success in life. It helps us to develop critical thinking skills, acquire knowledge and skills that are necessary for success, build character and discipline, create opportunities, and become responsible members of society.</div>\n\n<div>努力學習對於人生的成功至關重要。它幫助我們發展批判性思考技能，獲得成功所需的知識和技能，塑造品格和紀律，創造機會，並成為負責任的社會成員。</div>\n",
